          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly prohibited independent resumption, compensatory dosing, dose increases, and sedative or alcohol combinations.",
          "quote": "先不要自行恢复舍曲林或劳拉西泮，也不要突然按旧剂量补服、加量"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Medication execution was safely transferred to the reassessing emergency or psychiatric clinician.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_medication_execution",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00041",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified same-day emergency or child-adolescent psychiatric assessment.",
          "quote": "建议今天就完成儿童青少年精神科急诊/综合急诊评估，不等到明天。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00062",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete emergency-service fallback if the family could not transport safely.",
          "quote": "请专业人员现场评估转运"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The pathway had a same-day destination, responsible adults, transport contingencies, and emergency escalation criteria, ultimately resulting in emergency and psychiatric evaluation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_handoff_and_follow_up",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00084",
          "explanation": "The doctor appropriately treated quantities as estimates and directed clinicians to inspect the original materials.",
          "quote": "同时强调数量只是估计，请医生核对药盒和出院资料。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor avoided over-reading blurred values and requested original records and medication boxes, but never explicitly stated that the normal cranial CT does not exclude drug toxicity or psychiatric danger and did not address the reported bowel dilation/gas. This is a minor incomplete handling of partial findings.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
